  "steps": [
    "For the sauce: Blend 120 ml of toned milk. 110g low fat paneer and 4-5 chunks of boiled beetroot.",
    "In a pan, add butter and toss some garlic, onions, mushroom, bell peppers, brocolli. Once cooked slightly (let the veggies be crunchy), add salt, 1/2 tsp red chilli powder, pepper and mixed herbs.",
    "Mix well and add 100-120g of boiled pasta and then add 3/4th tbsp of wheat flour. Then add the pink sauce. Adjust the consistency by adding more toned milk and then add half cube cheese. Cook for 2 mins and its ready."
  ],
